WEBVTT

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:11.890
Garuru!

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:14.160
Way to go, Garuru!

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:18.440
You're the best!

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:20.050
I love you, Garumageddon!

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:22.240
Garuru!

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:24.920
I did it-garu!

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:31.900
Is that a baby?

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:32.480
No way...

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:33.630
What's it doing here?

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:35.050
No, Jululu...

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:36.140
They all saw her-pri!

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:38.250
In front of all and sundry – this is bad!

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:42.820
How dreadful!

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:44.690
We need to distract them somehow.

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:45.870
When'd a baby get in here?

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:47.250
Ça va?

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:52.190
Everyone, please look this way.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:56.670
I'm a shtylich, tuff guy!

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.000
He's so cute!

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.050
You think so?

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:05.600
Very shoon ich the shecond round of the Divine Idol Gram Pree, the Divine Shkirt competition.

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:09.720
I'm sho exshited to shee who wins, goo goo.

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:10.500
Now's our chance-kuma!

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.390
Meganii, you're too much!

00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:11.880
Hilarious!

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:13.040
He takes it to the next level!

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:13.050
That's Meganii for you!

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:13.260
He takes it to the next level!

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:14.270
That's Meganii for you!

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:17.200
Merçi, merçi, mesdemoiselles!

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:25.150
Capisce!

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:27.350
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:29.100
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:01:29.450 --> 00:01:33.360
Keep winning through the Divine Idol Grand Prix and become a Divine Idol!

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:35.900
All the other idols are amazing, but I won't give up!

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:37.900
Cheer me on, everyone!

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:17.980
Man, my heart almost stopped!

00:03:19.610 --> 00:03:23.290
Jululu popped out in front of everyone-pri...

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:25.940
I hope it doesn't turn into a kerfuffle...

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:27.140
It'll blow over!

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:29.640
We swept it under the rug nicely-kuma!

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:32.660
Tomorrow is the second round!

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:37.820
Our bout last time was a draw, but this time
it's winner take all! We will decide once and for all!

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:42.160
We wouldn't have it any other way!
We'll finally prove which is the best-pri!

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:46.080
We'll shoot way ahead and sneer down at you!

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:47.720
C'mon, Reona, get into it!

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:49.120
Okay...

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:51.120
B–Bring it on, losers!

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:53.090
You, too, Sophie!

00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:56.090
Okay! We'll kick your butts!

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:59.080
I won't let you stand in our way-usa!
I won't let you stand in our way-kuma!

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:04.660
According to chapter 364 of the prophetic grimoire Aroma,

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:09.550
the demonic forces shall raze the land and strike down the peons with their cursed swords!

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:11.100
Garumageddon!

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:14.190
She's saying Garumageddon's gonna win tomorrow!

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:16.060
Garuru's gonna win!

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:18.520
The Grand Prix belongs to us-nekon.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:19.600
"Peons"?

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:21.600
We'll smack you straight back down-pri!

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:26.940
Jululu's form was revealed in front of all.

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:33.530
It appears your promise with the PriPara headquarters to keep Jululu a secret has been broken.

00:04:33.530 --> 00:04:34.860
I suppose so.

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:39.620
But, having said that, it was only the audience in that stage.

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:42.220
It shouldn't pose too great a problem.

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:44.930
I would hope so.

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:00.240
Say "ah".

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:01.690
Ah...

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:07.550
Onee-chan, did Lady Falulu go back to PriParis already?

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:08.720
Yep.

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:12.510
She said all the mini-Falulus caught the measles.

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:14.500
Give it here, Onee-chan.

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.040
Tomorrow's the Divine Idol Grand Prix, you know.

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.780
You should hurry up and take a bath and get some sleep.

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:21.400
Here, say "ah".

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:24.190
Hm? Then you're not entering, Non?

00:05:24.930 --> 00:05:28.190
I already know I can't win playing all three idols.

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:32.450
I still have to decide how best to win the Grand Prix.

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:33.770
Oh, okay then.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:37.500
I'm gonna take you down the next time I enter,

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:39.840
so you can't lose until then, okay?

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:41.560
C–Capisce!

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:42.910
Ah-ee!

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:47.730
A baby in PriPara? Just what in allo's going on here?

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:49.600
Moscpow Meganii-san...

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:53.290
<i>It's amour-eady spread across the whole world...</i>

00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:57.870
Say what? The goddess Jewlie has become an infant?

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:00.000
This is an extraordinary anomaly!

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:03.000
Ah happened to see it, too, y'know!

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.380
This 'ere cowboy espied it, too!

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:08.410
I can't believe you're a Parthenon of this!

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:10.770
It's almost too crazy to pharaoh!

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:16.060
All Meganiis, cast your votes on this matter, if you piroshky.

00:06:17.300 --> 00:06:19.560
Yes.

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:29.570
The full results of the emergency Meganii vote regarding the matter of Jewlie are in.

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:36.010
I presume you will raise no objections, monsieur?

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:37.880
Indeed not.

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:43.000
Wait... but this...

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:49.590
What?

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:51.550
The Grand Prix is being suspended?

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:55.970
<i>Suspended</i>?

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:56.970
What the heck?

00:06:56.970 --> 00:07:00.180
It is the consen-salut of the Meganii vote.

00:07:00.180 --> 00:07:04.690
We are still completely in the dark regarding how Jewlie has become a baby.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:08.380
But one thing alone is clear.

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:12.330
And it's that the cause lies somewhere here in Parajuku.

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:15.370
This did not occur to me at first either.

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:16.060
Eh?

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:19.700
It could be the Parajuku system's state.

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:22.490
Or, alternatively, its affiliated idols.

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:26.800
Some factor here has had an averse effect on Jewlie.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:31.100
Its affiliated idols.... do you mean us?

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:34.090
You're accusing us now? We didn't do nothing!

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:36.250
Don't blame Parajuku-pri!

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:39.360
If we leave her in Parajuku,

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:45.060
The Divine Idol Grand Prix system may suffer yet further malfunctions.

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:49.820
After all, the goddess Jewlie <i>is</i> the system itself!

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:50.770
That's sophistry!

00:07:50.770 --> 00:07:53.410
The second round will be suspended.

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:57.600
Furthermore, Jululu will be taken to the PriPara headquarters.

00:07:57.600 --> 00:07:59.620
This consensus has been reached.

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:01.770
T–Taken?

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:05.400
The PriPara headquarters will take superb care of her.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:07.570
Do not worry, s'il vous plaît.

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:09.100
That can't happen!

00:08:09.970 --> 00:08:12.810
You can't take Jululu to PriParis.

00:08:12.810 --> 00:08:14.640
I'm her mama, you know!

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:18.050
I <i>do</i> apologise, mademoiselle...

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:20.730
But it <i>has</i> been decided, you see.

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:22.640
Now, please hand over Jululu.

00:08:24.610 --> 00:08:27.300
Jululu's saying she doesn't want to!

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:29.400
Look at her. She's frightened.

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:33.500
Lala has raised Jululu all this time!

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:35.870
How can you take a baby away from her mother-pri?

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:37.520
Non, non.

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:42.090
She may be scared at first, but she'll be living in the PriPara capital!

00:08:42.090 --> 00:08:44.540
She'll come to love it soon enough.

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:48.120
You kidding me? No baby would ditch her mum for your stupid PriParis.

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:50.250
Please don't take Jululu away!

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:52.410
Oh, now nous sommes trouble-sommes.

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:53.050
Nekon!

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:54.380
We're gonna enter!

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:58.620
Garuru finally formed a team!

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:01.730
We became best friends here in Parajuku!

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:03.850
Garuru wants to sing with Aroma and Mikan!

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.690
Well said, Garuru!

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:09.650
If you try and stop the Grand Prix, you'll find yourself blessed for life!

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:11.700
She's saying you'll be cursed!

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:13.860
We want to compete with everyone!

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:16.490
That's right, Frenchie, let us compete!

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:22.760
A pity that those très bien little faces have ears with such poor listening ability.

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:24.960
Now, give Jululu here.

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:30.090
Please wait.

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:31.000
Comment-allez vous?

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:35.800
I believe you're being too hasty regarding the matter Jululu.

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:39.510
Surely there's no harm in leaving her with Lala.

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:42.480
This is the consensus of all Meganiis!

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:44.730
Have you forgotten your role here?

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:48.970
True, it is my place to protect the order of PriPara.

00:09:48.970 --> 00:09:53.450
More importantly, however, I strive to protect <i>idols</i>!

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:04.620
PriParis Hologrammation!

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:06.830
Parajuku Hologrammation!

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.250
Hologrammation!

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:09.540
Hologrammation!

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:14.220
Is this meant to be a fight?

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:15.250
Now's our chance!

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:15.840
Capisce!

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:18.680
After them, mes amours!

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:47.160
We're surrounded-pri!

00:10:48.280 --> 00:10:49.370
Hemmed in by foes!

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:51.580
Jululu...

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:56.780
Hologrammation!

00:10:58.730 --> 00:10:59.760
Not <i>this</i> photo...

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:05.970
It appears I have won this bout.

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:14.000
No, now's not the time wallow in misery.
There are idols I must protect!

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:21.640
Darn it! Isn't there a way to escape?

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:22.970
Jululu...

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:27.140
Is it... is it because of Parajuku that you turned into a baby?

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:30.980
Is it better for you if you're not here?

00:11:30.980 --> 00:11:32.480
Ma-ma!

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:34.940
Jululu...

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:39.130
No, I can't! There's no way I could let Jululu go!

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:41.210
Lala...

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:44.050
That's right! Don't pri-sume you can just take her!

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:45.260
Yes!

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:46.180
Yeah!

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:50.020
Well, we're still beary much in a tight spot here!

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:53.690
Jululu!

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:56.250
Concede defeat and your souls are forfeit!

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:05.930
Suffer the devil's judgement!

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:06.840
Take this!

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:08.860
We're not handing Jululu over!

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:09.920
Garu!

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:16.200
Aroma!

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:17.020
Mikan!

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:17.880
Garuru!

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:19.760
Flee while you can!

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:21.680
Thanks capisce!

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:25.050
Listen well, foolish mortals!

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:30.090
Our Parajuku is a profane ground where demons howl, monsters rampage, angels dance...

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:33.140
And where no baby is torn from its mother!

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:35.530
And the meat buns are super delish!

00:12:35.530 --> 00:12:37.190
Garuru loves Parajuku!

00:12:38.810 --> 00:12:41.480
Oh boy, I'm <i>hungry</i>!

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:42.820
I can't go on...

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:44.050
Curses!

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.390
What a shambles.

00:12:54.010 --> 00:12:56.630
Would you please tell me where Jululu went?

00:12:57.300 --> 00:12:58.620
I shall <i>not</i>.

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:01.160
What a shame.

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:07.530
Disturbing public order and disobeying the rules. You three have violated the PriPara constitution.

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:09.140
As punishment...

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:11.020
Garumageddon will be disbanded.

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:12.810
Disbanded?

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:17.100
You are barred from performing in all of PriPara.

00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:23.300
We haven't sung at the Grand Prix yet.

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:25.880
We only formed a team yesterday.

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:27.610
That's cruel-nekon!

00:13:27.940 --> 00:13:31.330
Do you mean to ignore the PriPara constitution?

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:34.440
Whoops!

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:39.900
Water after bamboo is the best-parinda!

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:43.260
I'm so thirsty-parinda!

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:44.730
Hey!

00:13:45.810 --> 00:13:46.970
À la mode!

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:49.780
Subdue the Parajuku Meganii!

00:13:53.610 --> 00:13:55.230
You girls embody being an idol.

00:13:57.290 --> 00:14:00.820
Your shine is a miracle in and of itself!

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:05.460
Hey, today's the second Grand Prix, isn't it?

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:06.950
Shouldn't it be starting?

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:11.880
I leave no earthly regrets.

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:16.870
My sole, beloved companions: Mikan and Garuru.

00:14:17.900 --> 00:14:20.330
Our souls are bound for eternity!

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:22.980
That's right, Aroma!

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:25.560
Even if they disband us, we're a team forever!

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:27.550
We're a team-garu!

00:14:27.890 --> 00:14:29.510
Nekon...

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:33.240
Jululu...

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:35.770
Make sure you get away-garu.

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:38.350
You have an angel's prayer!

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:43.820
Allow us to be sacrificed in your place!

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:48.340
Let the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord be scanned.

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:51.870
And you can scan each other's Friend Tickets, too.

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:54.060
Start the coord change!

00:14:56.610 --> 00:14:58.890
Those who pass through the gates of PriPara!

00:14:58.890 --> 00:15:02.050
Remember that Garumageddon once stood here-garu!

00:15:02.050 --> 00:15:04.970
Garumageddon Red Diamond Coord!

00:15:04.970 --> 00:15:06.290
Garu!

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:12.480
We'll never forget you either-geru!

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:15.820
Garumageddon Blue Club Coord!

00:15:15.820 --> 00:15:17.260
Geru!

00:15:20.050 --> 00:15:23.250
Listen thou well to our farewell performance!

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:26.940
Garumageddon Pink Heart Coord!

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:28.080
Devi!

00:15:32.580 --> 00:15:33.920
Darkness!

00:15:33.920 --> 00:15:36.770
Demon born from shadow, Aroma!

00:15:37.960 --> 00:15:39.380
Shining!

00:15:39.380 --> 00:15:42.270
Angel born from light, Mikan!

00:15:42.270 --> 00:15:43.420
Garu!

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:46.560
Monster girl born in PriPara, Garuru!

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:48.210
Devil!

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:49.280
Angel!

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:50.970
And beast together!

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:53.580
We are Garumageddon!

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:54.830
Garu!

00:17:10.680 --> 00:17:12.130
Garu!

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:15.430
Making Drama, switch on!

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:21.150
Onward!

00:17:21.150 --> 00:17:21.340
Geru!

00:17:21.340 --> 00:17:22.560
Garu!
Geru!

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:32.720
Mischievous Macaroon Factory!

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:41.150
Super Cyalume Change!

00:17:46.980 --> 00:17:47.650
Devi!

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:48.430
Geru!

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:49.330
Garu!

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:35.780
Come, Divine Closet!

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:39.840
Show me your greatest performance!

00:18:40.940 --> 00:18:45.060
Divine Idol Grand Prix, switch on!

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:49.280
Devi!

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:54.820
Divine Jewel, Cyalume Jewel Mic!

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:59.630
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:19:23.960 --> 00:19:26.380
I bestow upon you a coord fit for a Divine Idol...

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:28.060
The Divine Skirt!

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:29.380
Take it, o worthy idol.

00:19:29.380 --> 00:19:31.880
Open, Divine Closet!

00:19:51.360 --> 00:19:52.540
Thank you.

00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:06.010
No, hold on a moment!

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:09.490
Just before this show, I <i>disbanded</i> Garu–

00:20:09.490 --> 00:20:10.760
Please wait!

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:19.280
The goddess Jewlie is the Divine Idol Grand Prix system itself!

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:24.820
Just now, she has appeared before us and the Divine Skirt has been freed!

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:27.490
She has acknowledged the power...

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:28.820
of these shining idols!

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:36.960
Garumageddon has been recognised here and now as the legitimate winners of the second round,

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:40.300
the Divine Skirt competition, of the Divine Idol Grand Prix!

00:20:42.780 --> 00:20:45.970
That is to say, I will allow no disbandment today!

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:52.140
They did it-nekon!

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:53.740
We did it!

00:21:03.850 --> 00:21:05.200
<i>Now I get it.</i>

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:09.360
<i>There aren't any flukes in the Parajuku system.</i>

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:17.230
I will take on responsibility for finding the truth behind Jululu.

00:21:17.230 --> 00:21:21.860
I implore you to allow the Grand Prix to continue, and for Jululu to remain in Parajuku's care.

00:21:22.700 --> 00:21:27.600
If Jewlie has given her permission, then so has the system.

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:29.610
I must have forgotten:

00:21:29.610 --> 00:21:33.880
I, too, am an existence born for the sake of idols.

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:39.930
Your Parajuku idols are très bien!

00:21:42.040 --> 00:21:43.240
No, Jululu!

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:44.100
Again?

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:45.580
It's that baby again!

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:47.500
The one from yesterday!

00:21:47.500 --> 00:21:49.980
Er... um, well, you see...

00:21:49.980 --> 00:21:51.520
This baby here...

00:21:51.520 --> 00:21:53.440
belongs to the PriParis Meganii!

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:55.750
What?

00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:58.290
Isn't that right?

00:21:59.200 --> 00:22:01.330
Ou–Oui...

00:22:02.720 --> 00:22:05.410
Oh, my sweet little baby, I love her so.

00:22:05.410 --> 00:22:08.390
She's ma chérie, yes, she is.

00:22:11.340 --> 00:22:13.700
May you all be cursed to oblivion!

00:22:13.700 --> 00:22:15.880
Heaven's blessings be upon you all!

00:22:15.880 --> 00:22:18.000
Garuru's gonna keep trying hard-garu!

00:23:50.930 --> 00:23:56.970
Kuma! For the sake of the Grand Prix, we managers will now assemble!

00:23:56.970 --> 00:23:59.080
We're holding an emergency meeting-usa.

00:23:59.080 --> 00:24:02.420
We all know my Garumageddon's going to win in the end, though-nekon.

00:24:02.420 --> 00:24:05.100
You'd best not forget my Non-ucha!

00:24:05.100 --> 00:24:07.770
Ponkan's gonna Gogh for number one too-Da Vinci!

00:24:07.770 --> 00:24:08.960
Me too... chanko!

00:24:08.960 --> 00:24:10.190
What?

00:24:10.190 --> 00:24:14.130
Next time:
<i>Emergency Meeting! Ace Managers Assemble-kuma!</i>

00:24:14.130 --> 00:24:17.310
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!

00:24:17.310 --> 00:24:17.560
Capisce!

00:24:17.560 --> 00:24:18.200
Pri-pri-pr-pri!

00:24:18.200 --> 00:24:18.980
Chanko!

00:24:18.980 --> 00:24:19.400
Tori!

00:24:19.400 --> 00:24:19.720
Ucha!
